{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-05-10 08:12:00', 'title': 'PNC APPOINTS RENU KHATOR TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , MAY 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) APPOINTED RENU KHATOR, PH.D., CHANCELLOR OF THE UNIVERSITY OF HOUSTON SYSTEM AND PRESIDENT OF UNIVERSITY OF HOUSTON, TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE TODAY.'}